{"content": "The release codename mentioned in the comment is **AZURE-LANTERN-8090**.\n\nThe first class defined in the excerpt, `Message`, serves as the basic object for the email package's object model, representing an email message with RFC 2822 headers and a payload. It provides methods to manipulate headers, access or modify the payload (which can be a string or a list of sub-messages), and serialize the message into string or bytes formats.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.49591694328234226, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.49591694328234226}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.200142483443475}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.6248556182091}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -4.91043911430285}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -5.161131481856561}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -6.280516247481561}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.367369274825311}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -8.618029217452264}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -9.024708370894647}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -10.109680752486444}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -10.14432583305285}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.657656292647577}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -10.69417057487414}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -11.001337628096795}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -11.04040966483996}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -11.24670849296496}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -11.369379620284295}, {"token": "release", "logprob": -11.40687237235949}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -11.42188702079699}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -11.48852978202746}]}, {"token": " release", "logprob": -0.0001297099946242497, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " release", "logprob": -0.0001297099946242497}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -9.11249924734814}, {"token": " specific", "logprob": -13.452838907992671}, {"token": " code", "logprob": -13.582717905795405}, {"token": " mention", "logprob": -13.667724619662593}, {"token": " note", "logprob": -13.719726572787593}, {"token": " comment", "logprob": -13.76679612234814}, {"t