{"content": "The release codename mentioned in the comment is **AZURE-TUNDRA-1150**.\n\nThe first class defined in the excerpt, `_HAS_DEFAULT_FACTORY_CLASS`, serves as a sentinel object to signal that a field's default value should be initialized using a factory function rather than a static value. It provides a custom `__repr__` method that returns the string `'<factory>'` to make debugging and error messages more readable when this sentinel is displayed.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.4548469068913832, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.4548469068913832}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.2745681288152113}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.8552527906804457}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -4.176572370758571}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -4.909438657990016}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -5.844277906647243}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.282331037750758}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -8.608197736969508}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -9.305137205353297}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -9.536790418854274}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.943669843903102}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -10.277505445709743}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.467917967072047}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -10.73986868881277}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -10.77309279464773}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -10.988603162994899}, {"token": "Hello", "logprob": -11.151006269684352}, {"token": "release", "logprob": -11.221843290558375}, {"token": "<tool_call>", "logprob": -11.2505021574407}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -11.302354383698024}]}, {"token": " release", "logprob": -0.0002273879440970461, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " release", "logprob": -0.0002273879440970461}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -8.497549470463628}, {"token": " code", "logprob": -12.672161515751714}, {"token": " second", "logprob": -13.008875306645269}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -13.351198609867925}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -13.370497163334722}, {"token": " released", "logprob": -13.66929